# --- vendored CUT3R (see CUT3R/UPSTREAM.md) ---
# `docs/` above matches at any depth and would swallow CUT3R's own docs, which
# carry the training/eval protocol we reproduce against.
!CUT3R/docs/
# ~99 MB of README gifs and demo media. Not needed to run eval/ or import
# src/dust3r; demo.py is the only consumer of examples/.
CUT3R/assets/
CUT3R/examples/
CUT3R/cut3r.pdf

# --- vendored TTT3R / ZipMap (see their UPSTREAM.md) ---
# demo media only; not needed for eval
TTT3R/examples/
ZipMap/examples/
!TTT3R/docs/
